        <mxCell id="AfsNHlJ17FuFmVLx_NQ8-13" parent="1" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=top;rounded=0;" value="&lt;font face=&quot;Ubuntu Sans Mono&quot; data-font-src=&quot;https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Ubuntu+Sans+Mono:ital,wght@0,400..700;1,400..700&amp;amp;display=swap&quot; style=&quot;font-size: 20px;&quot;&gt;Grow the heap by using &lt;b style=&quot;&quot;&gt;sbr()&lt;/b&gt;&amp;nbsp;to extend the size of the heap:&lt;/font&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;Ubuntu Sans Mono&quot; data-font-src=&quot;https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Ubuntu+Sans+Mono:ital,wght@0,400..700;1,400..700&amp;amp;display=swap&quot; style=&quot;font-size: 20px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;ol&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;Ubuntu Sans Mono&quot; style=&quot;font-size: 20px;&quot;&gt;Each new allocation includes an &lt;b&gt;embedded header&lt;/b&gt;&amp;nbsp;that tracks the &lt;b&gt;capacity&lt;/b&gt;&amp;nbsp;of the data block (&lt;i&gt;not including the header&lt;/i&gt;) and the &lt;b&gt;size&lt;/b&gt;&amp;nbsp;actually used&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;Ubuntu Sans Mono&quot; style=&quot;font-size: 20px;&quot;&gt;Although blocks are contiguous, we need &lt;b style=&quot;&quot;&gt;prev&lt;/b&gt;&amp;nbsp;and &lt;b style=&quot;&quot;&gt;next&lt;/b&gt;&amp;nbsp;pointer to be able to traverse through them as a list since the allocations are not fixed size&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ol&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1">
